  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenska R&#xf6;da Korset, Rapid Respons Mechanism 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Red Cross, Rapid Respons Mechanism 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RRM mechanism has proven to be a fast and efficient resource for SRC  to provide an early response to sudden disasters. SRC channel in 2012 emergency humanitarian assistance through the International Red Cross Federation (IFRC) to sudden humanitarian crises.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RRM mekanismen har visat sig vara en snabb och effektiv resurs f&#xf6;r    att SRK ska kunna ge en tidig respons p&#xe5; pl&#xf6;tsliga katastrofer. SRK   kanaliserar under 2012 akut humanit&#xe4;rt st&#xf6;d via Internationella R&#xf6;da  Korsfederationen (IFRC) till pl&#xf6;tsligt uppkomna humanit&#xe4;ra            katastrofer.</narrative>
  </description>
